年春〖10〗，魏大将军曹爽率步骑十余万，向汉川","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"shaodi-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗五年：正始五年（公元 244）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f0539e2dfb395a33b142","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"正始五年，爽乃西至长安，大发卒六七万人，从骆谷入。是时，关中及氐、羌转输不能供〖11〗，牛马骡驴多死，民夷号泣道路。入谷行数百里，贼因山为固，兵不得进。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76},{"id":"zhonghua-q-86ec12b15185da9d6139","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-41f9446b40aedbae50f2","layer":"original","quote":"毓与书曰：“窃以为庙胜之策，不临矢石〖7〗；王者之兵，有征无战。诚以干戚可以服有苗〖8〗，退舍足以纳原寇〖9〗；不必纵吴汉于江关〖10〗，骋韩信于井陉也〖11〗。见可而进，知难而退，盖自古之政。惟公侯详之。”","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":148}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
